@base = http://localhost:8088
@token = paste-accessToken-here
@admin = paste-admin-accessToken-here

### Login (password matches local .env)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@hrms.local","password":"Demo-password-123"}

### Search
GET {{base}}/api/hotels?city=Stockholm&guests=2

### Calendar (choose future dates)
GET {{base}}/api/room-types/1/calendar?checkIn=2026-11-01&checkOut=2026-11-04

### Quote
POST {{base}}/api/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomTypeId":1,"checkIn":"2026-11-01","checkOut":"2026-11-04","quantity":1}

### Create booking: retain both quoteId and clientRequestId on retry
POST {{base}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quoteId":"paste-quote-id","clientRequestId":"reservation-demo-1"}

### Controlled simulated gateway (use your own booking ID)
POST {{base}}/api/payment/simulate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookingId":1,"providerRef":"demo-payment-1","success":true}

### Cancel
POST {{base}}/api/bookings/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Operational state
GET {{base}}/api/admin/ops
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Reconciliation
GET {{base}}/api/admin/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
